<title>FRANCE: French broker CCF downgrades DMC - source.</title>
<headline>French broker CCF downgrades DMC - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage CCF Elysees Bourse has lowered its rating on textiles company DMC to &quot;lighten&quot; from &quot;strengthen&quot;, based on a view the stock is fully valued, fund managers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The broker considers the DMC share price reflects the company's repositioning and advises clients to take profits until the stock price comes down to 140 francs.</p>
<p>DMC was down 3.03 percent at 163.10 francs at 1601 GMT, while the market was down 0.51 percent.</p>
</text>
